1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,180
Could everybody please stop working for a minute and listen carefully?

2
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:06,480
As you know, there are only four days until Christmas.

3
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:11,600
Our company has been approached by the St. Vincent de Paul Society with an urgent request.

4
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:18,240
St. Vincent's Christmas Appeal aims to provide blankets and hot meals to all of the city's homeless on Christmas Day.

5
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:22,820
However, this year they have not received a sufficient number of blankets.

6
00:00:23,535 --> 00:00:27,020
Could all of you please check your cupboards to see if you have any warm blankets to spare?

7
00:00:27,945 --> 00:00:30,070
Please only bring clean blankets in good condition.

8
00:00:30,995 --> 00:00:35,920
Collectors from St. Vincent's will be calling tomorrow and Friday, so I hope you all can help out.
